= Staal's Influence

Although Staal insists he has no intention of establishing a military dictatorship and claims the Commonwealth Army is merely stabilizing the nation in its time of need, we suspect he is maneuvering to consolidate power.

This, of course, involves the infiltration of his supporters into the Greater Worker's Guild and the quiet persuasion of <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> leaders through shady deals and under-the-table arrangements.

It is already evident that our decision-making is being compromised.

- @root: Ok.
